('The acidic strength of hydrides of Group 16 increases as', 'H$_2$O $>$ H$_2$S $>$ H$_2$Se $>$ H$_2$Te', 'H$_2$Te $>$ H$_2$Se $>$ H$_2$S $>$ H$_2$O', 'All are equally acidic', 'H$_2$O is the strongest acid', 'option2', 'Down the group: bond strength decreases (H-X bond weaker), making it easier to release H$^+$. H$_2$Te is the strongest acid.', 'c_p_block_general', 2, 'JEE Mains Prep', 'approved'),
